{"version":"1.0.0","enabled":true,"name":"eve-sdl-preflight","description":"Legacy (pre-1.0 IDE) twin of eve-sdl-preflight.json. Pre-1.0 has no session-start trigger, so it fires on promptSubmit (same choice as aidlc-session-start.kiro.hook). Runs eve-sdl-preflight.sh (plain sh, no bun) so it fires even when bun is absent; detect + instruct only, never blocks. Checks (A) bun + eve installed/on PATH (the PreToolUse eve-sdl-gate hard-blocks if not) and (B) AMAIISDOM credentials for eve's opengrep scanner — when none are stored it directs the user to run `eve credentials amaiisdom <username>` themselves in the terminal (eve prompts securely; the agent never sees the password).","when":{"type":"promptSubmit"},"then":{"type":"runCommand","command":"sh .kiro/hooks/eve-sdl-preflight.sh"}}
